{"about_the_game":"Play Domino game in DomiCard.  You can create as many dominos as you want in this game before your computer gets burned. Also, &quot;Cubes&quot; can be used to build anything you like, such as a bridge, a gate, or some other buildings.<br />\r\nFollow me on Twitter to find out more interesting videos.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRight now, this game supports Single-player and Multiplayer (Local area network and online), the Workshop is available as well!<br />\r\nDomiCard is just a simulation, try to play domino game in the real world with your friends, you may make a leap.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlease leave comments for helping me to improve this game.<br />\r\nNote: a folder &quot;savedExamples&quot; is under &quot;/SteamApps/common/DomiCard/DomiCard_Data/savedExamples&quot;. Players can load those three example folders and have a shoot with them. Also, there are some projects available on the Steam Workshop. Hope you enjoy.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"558cc9a7440e16790dc4a57930158696ed8d9b10.jpg","localized_name":"100 dominos","name":"100 dominos","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/886330/558cc9a7440e16790dc4a57930158696ed8d9b10.jpg"},{"icon":"9ce3be053b2d42885bced06f869f1ce2424bcb4a.jpg","localized_name":"1000 dominos","name":"1000 dominos","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/886330/9ce3be053b2d42885bced06f869f1ce2424bcb4a.jpg"},{"icon":"bdc7452454f301f2ea828b3e9c06997505e53d3c.jpg","localized_name":"Ready to play","name":"Ready to play","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/886330/bdc7452454f301f2ea828b3e9c06997505e53d3c.jpg"},{"icon":"752adc09300b0ade5547aa8588ca15d7840560f9.jpg","localized_name":"Props Master","name":"Props Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/886330/752adc09300b0ade5547aa8588ca15d7840560f9.jpg"},{"icon":"92a1b01d651a32b2ad9a531769d1e97e27ef8a84.jpg","loca